CONTEXT ProjectAdmin IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT ProjectAdmin
{+ Benchmark model for `ampersand incremental-bench`: a handful of
   inclusion rules over compositions, a converse, and a transitive
   closure — the violation shapes the incremental circuits must carry.
   The population is synthetic, generated by the benchmark itself. +}

RELATION memberOf[Person*Team]
RELATION leads[Person*Team]
RELATION worksOn[Person*Project]
RELATION assignedTo[Project*Team]
RELATION mentors[Person*Person]

RULE leaderIsMember : leads |- memberOf
MEANING "Whoever leads a team is a member of that team."

RULE workOnAssigned : worksOn;assignedTo |- memberOf
MEANING "Whoever works on a project is a member of a team the project is assigned to."

RULE mentorKnowsTeam : mentors |- memberOf;memberOf~
MEANING "A mentor shares at least one team with the person mentored."

RULE noSelfMentor : mentors |- -I[Person]
MEANING "Nobody mentors themselves."

RULE noMentorCycle : mentors;mentors |- -I[Person]
MEANING "Mentorship does not close a two-cycle."

ENDCONTEXT
